    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546480/extras/9521042b1c6a36cdb415b3b14c666fc3.poster.avif?t=1750666683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546480/extras/9521042b1c6a36cdb415b3b14c666fc3.webm?t=1750666683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546480/extras/9521042b1c6a36cdb415b3b14c666fc3.mp4?t=1750666683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A relaxing fantasy archeology sandbox.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIG THROUGH VOXEL SAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And uncover interdimensional artifacts. Whether it's relics of the medieval era or remnants of a robotic utopia, there's always something extraordinary waiting to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHOWCASE THE ARTIFACTS YOU FIND IN THE MUSEUM</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the creative freedom to construct anything you desire using the discovered artifacts in building mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINE CRYSTALS FOR SHARDS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That can be used as currency to purchase various exciting items and services.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOSS INFERNO ORBS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That blast the sand and shoot you up if they explode close by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GLIDE THROUGH THE INFINITY ISLETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each islet is procedurally generated and unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > During your journeys through various dimensions, you unexpectedly find yourself at an empty and mysterious interdimensional museum. The enigmatic director of the museum asks for your help to restore it after a cataclysmic interdimensional collision. He grants you the power to summon a magical spade, capable of digging through the sands of Infinity Islets to unearth hidden interdimensional artifacts. Your mission is to return these artifacts to the museum, bringing it back to its former glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Infinity Islets, you are a wanderer gliding through an infinite expanse of islets in search of interdimensional artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy  free game updates for life and the new content that comes with them.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546480/extras/9521042b1c6a36cdb415b3b14c666fc3.poster.avif?t=1750666683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546480/extras/9521042b1c6a36cdb415b3b14c666fc3.webm?t=1750666683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546480/extras/9521042b1c6a36cdb415b3b14c666fc3.mp4?t=1750666683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A relaxing fantasy archeology sandbox.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIG THROUGH VOXEL SAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And uncover interdimensional artifacts. Whether it's relics of the medieval era or remnants of a robotic utopia, there's always something extraordinary waiting to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHOWCASE THE ARTIFACTS YOU FIND IN THE MUSEUM</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the creative freedom to construct anything you desire using the discovered artifacts in building mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINE CRYSTALS FOR SHARDS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That can be used as currency to purchase various exciting items and services.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOSS INFERNO ORBS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That blast the sand and shoot you up if they explode close by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GLIDE THROUGH THE INFINITY ISLETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each islet is procedurally generated and unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > During your journeys through various dimensions, you unexpectedly find yourself at an empty and mysterious interdimensional museum. The enigmatic director of the museum asks for your help to restore it after a cataclysmic interdimensional collision. He grants you the power to summon a magical spade, capable of digging through the sands of Infinity Islets to unearth hidden interdimensional artifacts. Your mission is to return these artifacts to the museum, bringing it back to its former glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Infinity Islets, you are a wanderer gliding through an infinite expanse of islets in search of interdimensional artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy  free game updates for life and the new content that comes with them.</strong></p>",
